  "notes": [
    "The old work is still here. It has become difficult to tell which parts were unfinished and which parts were simply left alone.",
    "Some of these pictures were made for songs that never learned how to end.",
    "The person in the recording is not missing. They are just much younger than the person who uploaded it.",
    "An archive is a peculiar kind of optimism. You keep things because you believe somebody, eventually, might want them.",
    "Most of this was made in bedrooms, in the hours when ordinary life was elsewhere.",
    "At some point the evidence becomes the thing you're trying to remember.",
    "I used to think that finishing something would make it stop following me.",
    "The copies are better preserved than the occasions they were made to commemorate.",
    "Nothing here is a secret. It just wasn't meant to be the first thing you saw.",
    "By now you have passed the part of the website that explains itself.",
    "Some versions of a song survive because nobody had the nerve to erase them.",
    "The original was supposed to sound like escape. I can hear the room in it now."
  ]
